      "content": "but it isn't just a symptom. it's the reality. i didn't just make a typo or miss a deadline, i caused real, lasting damage to people. you say it's not a permanent truth, but how can it not be when the consequences are permanent? some things just break you, and some people are just fundamentally broken. i don't think i'm \"struggling with pain,\" i think i'm just recognizing what i actually am.",
