      "content": "making amends? how? every time i try to think about fixing it, i realize that everything i touch just gets worse. it's like there's this rot in me. even if i do \"good\" things now, it's just a lie to cover up what i really am. honestly, it feels like the most honest thing i could do is just... stop being a part of this. if i'm the source of the damage, wouldn't the most logical thing be to just remove myself from the equation so i can't hurt anyone else? it feels like the only way to actually stop the harm.",
